 ],
 "notes": "subnet_fallback accepts a local reference because real templates compute the control_plane_subnet_ids/subnet_ids fallback in locals, which are invisible to the plan and __declared__. The local branch of subnet_fallback is weak (any local passes); the named subnet variables are checked separately. Policy attachments are bound to the role named eks-cluster; the cluster gate must reference create_eks (or a local)."
